        bias:   the learnable bias of the module of shape
                :math:`\text{normalized\_shape}` when :attr:`elementwise_affine` is set to ``True``.
                The values are initialized to 0.

    Shape:
        - Input: :math:`(N, *)`
        - Output: :math:`(N, *)` (same shape as input)

